  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>General coordinate on a given circle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Square&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math>then add we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p